sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Server
    participant S as Task store
    H-->>C: id: 6, id: 7
    C->>C: IncompleteStream, last id 7
    C->>H: SubscribeToTask<br/>Last-Event-ID: 7
    H-->>C: Task snapshot (no id:)
    H->>S: read log after 7
    S-->>H: one page (subscribe_replay_limit)
    H-->>C: id: 8, id: 9 ...
    H->>S: next pages, until caught up
    H-->>C: live frames
